  Stops the root Directory.Build.props reaching the test projects. MSBuild imports the NEAREST
  Directory.Build.props and stops, so an empty one here is the whole mechanism.

  It has to stop. The root file exists to make the MOD compile: net48 against the game's own BCL
  taken from CSII_MANAGEDPATH, with implicit framework references and the reference-assembly
  packages turned off. A net8.0 test project inheriting any of that has no BCL at all.
